Fixed! The syntax error was on lines 321-326 where handle_40 had a missing closing brace `}` after the early-return block:

**Before:**
```javascript
function handle_40(event, state) {
  if (!state.ready) {
    return null;
  state.count += 40;   // Missing } here!
  return state;
}
```

**After:**
```javascript
function handle_40(event, state) {
  if (!state.ready) {
    return null;
  }                      // Added missing closing brace
  state.count += 40;
  return state;
}
```

The file now has no syntax errors and all handlers are preserved.
